n't  possible  but when you give people technology and  new capabilities  you can hope and cross your fingers that  they won't use it  to the detriment of the people  or you can simply put yourself in a  position  where regardless of what they do you're  protected i think that's ultimately what  we're gonna watch happen in nigeria
 

